# 🎧 AudioDigest

An AI-powered app that converts uploaded files (text, image, audio, PDF) into easy-to-understand audio summaries for fast revision.

## 🚀 Features
- Multi-format upload (Text, Image, Audio, PDF)
- AI topic extraction & simplification
- Natural audio generation
- Playlist mode for continuous revision
- Flashcard generator & voice command support

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
Python, Flask, OpenAI, gTTS, OCR

